cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Model Lab in research or a published comparison, please cite it."
title: "Model Lab: LLM Benchmark & Build Arena"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Moreira
    given-names: Hugo
repository-code: "https://github.com/hugosmoreira/model-lab"
license: MIT
version: 0.2.0-rc.1
date-released: 2026-09-20
abstract: >-
  Local-first tool for reproducible LLM comparisons: the same one-shot build
  challenge is sent to several cloud and local models under identical
  configuration, every generated artifact is executed and tested in a
  sandboxed browser, builds are graded by an order-swapped LLM judge that sees
  the rendered frame, and results export as bundles that trace back to a
  content-addressed run fingerprint.
keywords:
  - llm
  - benchmark
  - evaluation
  - llm-as-a-judge
  - playwright
